1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,010
Coffee, please. Whatever's hot. Thank you.

2
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:09,520
Here you go. You can take that table.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,400
Lid's loose. Hold the cup, not the top.

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:31,140
If the clinic calls, come get me. Doesn't matter how busy we are.

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,680
Back there. Isn't that the guy on the news? Don't point.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,280
You know him?

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,550
No. The picture. On the TV.

8
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,830
Okay. Let me look. Just stay here a minute.

9
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,810
Would you mind moving over there? I need to clear this section. I'll get your tray.

10
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,960
You don't have to finish. I'll bring it all over. Careful with that one.

11
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:03,360
I'm at the restaurant on Oak Street. A customer looks like the man you're looking for. I don't know if he's armed.

12
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,550
You wanted the receipt, right? Here.

13
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:38,240
Morning. Hands on the table, please. Got any ID?

14
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:55,660
Take the mask off. Slowly. Then tell me where your ID is.

15
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,380
Left jacket pocket.

16
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,400
This isn't checking out. Keep your hands there.

17
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,400
Take a second. Keep your hands in front.

18
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:58,260
Wait, let me get my balance. The bag's over there.
